      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("In the last leg of their journey to Southbay, Haldric and his companions find themselves in the Sewers of Southbay."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            portrait: "portraits/burin-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("Only a human could take such a lovely cave and fill it with refuse. Humans. Hey, is that a pair of boots?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We should be cautious down here. This isn’t an old maid’s drain pipe, this is the sewer of Southbay. It is said that the city diverted an underground river for its own use, and let their own effluent run down the old river bed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("This is the far end of that river bed. Legend has it—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tinry the Red",
            text: _("That a king banished a pair of twin magi and their devoted followers down here after the Wesfolk war!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Daellyn the Red",
            text: _("Can you feel it, brother? This one bears the Ruby of Fire. After all our time searching, it has come to us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tinry the Red",
            text: _("The brothers Red will finally ascend to power. We must have it. Get them!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-surprised.webp",
            text: _("Nooo! The wizards are flooding the sewer. We’re doomed!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Haldric, I feel a strong foreboding. Have you noticed that anything that happens to be strong in the ways of magic can sense that ruby? Elilmaldur-Rithrandil felt it, and so did Lich-Lord Caror, now these two."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We retrieved the Lich-Lord’s book, and I can literally feel the power of the ruby, even with it in my pack. Let’s work out what it does, before we decide what to do with it."),
          },
        ],
      },
